ull,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in 4.5 beta 3\n- Not reproducable in 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.5 beta 3\n\n### Issue description\n\nColleague and I are on the same OS, on the same Godot version and thousands of image files are regenerating their import files every time we checkout each others branches.\n\nOne adds, one removes.\n\n<img width=\"691\" height=\"315\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e0702f6-44b7-4e5d-9038-845676259dc3\" />\n<img width=\"778\" height=\"326\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cad70a32-6b2a-496a-9601-8c2c497a20fa\" />\n\n- It can't be blender versions because images are affected too.\n- It can't be beta version because we are both on beta 3\n- We nuked out .godot and AppData folders, it's not that\n\nWhat else is there?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Have a project with media across 2 identical setups\n- Import all files\n- Have them download the import files from source control\n- They automatically regenerate the import files with changes even though they shouldn't\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mvp.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21376949/mvp.tar.gz)","closed_by":{"login":"krazyjakee","id":623463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMzQ2Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/623463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krazyjakee","html_url":"https://github.com/krazyjakee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krazyjakee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krazyjakee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krazyjakee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krazyjakee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c